  "description": "The works comprise of:\n- Subdivision of an existing large chamber on the third floor into two smaller chambers\n- Installation of lightweight plasterboard stud partitions with acoustic insulation\n- Partitions scribed around existing skirting, cornices, and service trunking\n- Formation of a new door opening and reconfiguration of access\n- Retention and reuse of existing historic door leaf and ironmongery\n- Introduction of replica joinery to match existing architraves, skirting, and cornices\n- Minor electrical works, including lighting and fire detection upgrades\n\nNo historic fabric will be removed. All works are additive and reversible.",
